# Install Openclaw on Alibaba Cloud

## 1. Object

OpenClaw is more than just a personal AI assistant application, 
it’s a hub for powerful tools that have been integrated seamlessly.

In case we want to develop a custom AI agent service, we can use Openclaw as the AI agent framework, 
and deploy it to the cloud, like AWS or Alibaba cloud. 

The easiest way to install Openclaw in an Alibaba ECS instance 
is to use Alibaba's simple application server (轻量应用服务器). 

However, since alibaba's simple application server is tightly coupled, 
it is not convenient for custom development. 
